{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never\/defaultSize(_:_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"width"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Float"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"height"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Float","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"width","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default width for windows created from a scene."}]}]},{"name":"height","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default height for windows created from a scene."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A scene that uses a default size for new windows.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this scene modifier to indicate a default initial size for a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window that the system creates from a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" declaration. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, you can request that new windows that a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generates occupy 600 points in the x-dimension and 400 points in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the y-dimension:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultSize(width: 600, height: 400)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The size that you specify acts only as a default for when the window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first appears. People can later resize the window using interface"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controls that the system provides. Also, during state restoration,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system restores windows to their most recent size rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the default size."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you specify a default size that’s outside the range of the window’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inherent resizability in one or both dimensions, the system clamps the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"affected dimension to keep it in range. You can configure the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resizability of a scene using the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/windowResizability(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"modifier.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default size modifier affects any scene type that creates windows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in macOS, namely:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Window"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"DocumentGroup","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Settings","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to specify the size input in terms of size instance,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Scene\/defaultSize(_:)-5y8n"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE11defaultSizeyQrSf_SftF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s5NeverO","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"defaultSize(_:_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Float"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sf","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Float"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets a default width and height for a window.","typ